  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of five years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the roof extension and alterations hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building.",
    "Condition : 3 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the 2 x flats are occupied",
    "Condition : 4 - Before the development is commenced a scheme for protecting the proposed residential accommodation from excessive external and internal airborne noise and internal impact noise shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority and any works which form part of such as scheme shall be completed before any part of the development is first occupied or used.",
    "Condition : 5 - The car parking spaces shown on drawing No. 014/M/2000B received 11.2.02\r\n shall be provided before the dwelling to which it relates is occupied and thereafter it shall not be used for any purpose other than the parking of cars associated with occupiers of the property."
  ],
